      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563131112,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3  Probe directly\n\nCallMeMaybe (via DERP) +\ndisco Pings to each candidate:\nSTUN, LAN, IPv6, port-mapped",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b5",
      "originalText": "3  Probe directly\n\nCallMeMaybe (via DERP) +\ndisco Pings to each candidate:\nSTUN, LAN, IPv6, port-mapped",
